 progress to point K2, which they must reach before sunrise to enter Area Three. Isazu tells Kurose what he did.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rsGjU1PkXQMkajCVFXlXnGNB7Bp.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13346","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"99725","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36039","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"77778","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"340890","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"92847","synopsis":"The CAAC Special Forces intercept the group to try to take Aiko back. Kurose realizes that Isazu's daughter Yuzuha is connected to the Matter.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gFn6ggzhOeVMlX3Tkp8LPbx817u.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13346","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"99725","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36039","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"77778","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"340890","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"92848","synopsis":"The Divers confront Aiko and Kanzaki, but they agree to continue with the mission. Isazu becomes lab director and learns about Unit One.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yOhn4O0f3WJgwvOZQOk8GJ5Y4RT.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13346","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"99725","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36039","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"77778","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"